            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Futhi wabayala ukuba bafundise abantwana bakwaJuda ukusebenzisa umnsalo; bheka, kulotshiwe encwadini kaJasheri.)",
