              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lingakutsheli eGati, lingakwenzi kwaziwe ezitaladeni zeAshikeloni; ukuze amadodakazi amaFilisti angathokozi, namadodakazi angasokile angathokozi.",
