              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zintaba zaseGilibowa, makungabikho mazolo, kungabikho mvula phezu kwenu, namasimu emihlatshelo; ngoba kukhona isihlangu samaqhawe, isihlangu sikaSawuli esilahlwe lapho kungathi kagcotshiweyo amafutha.",
