              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Madodakazi akwa-Israyeli, mkhaleleni uSawule, owanigqokisa okubomvu nezinye izibiliboco, owafaka imihlobiso yegolide engutsheni yenu.",
          "type": "text",
